**/.pbi/
**/cache.abf
**/localSettings.json
**/unappliedChanges.json

# Ecommerce raw event logs (~14.7 GB) - never commit; build_summaries.py reads them
Ecommerce/raw_unedited/*.csv
**/2019-Oct.csv
**/2019-Nov.csv
Ecommerce/data/_work/
